      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I support the assertion that a world creator should have the ability to supercede the earmuff feature if they *actively* choose to do that.\nEarmuff should default to being allowed for accessibility concerns, but as a world creator I really very much dislike losing all control over users' voices.",
